compatibility-mode-warning-title = COMPATIBILITY MODE WARNING
compatibility-mode-warning-label = Compatibility Mode
compatibility-mode-warning-attention-label = Compatibility Mode is enabled; please read the text below!
compatibility-mode-warning-text =
    [bold]The server utilizes numerous shaders and effects that do not function in Compatibility Mode. Consequently, they have been automatically disabled, which may cause the game to appear visually distorted or incorrect.[/bold]
    Please disable Compatibility Mode within the [bold]Space Station 14 launcher settings[/bold] by unchecking the "Compatibility Mode" option. Afterward, close the game and reconnect to the server. 
    
    [italic]If you are unable to disable Compatibility Mode, please do the following: ECS -> Settings -> SCP Settings -> Compatibility Mode Warning.[/italic]
